        "Content": "Janet Carroll Estate Agents are delighted to offer this superb A3 rated end of terrace family home built in 2018, Approx.192sqm/2066 sq.ft for sale by private treaty.\n\nBuilt to the highest building standards, this stunning property is nestled in a beautifully matured development in a super prime residential location of South County Dublin. Close to Dundrum and Stillorgan Village, providing convenient access to an array of amenities including a very wide choice of National, Private and International schools. \n\nSpecial Features:\n\nHigh energy efficiency home: A3\nPrime Residential location: Close to so many amenities \nExceptional Schools: Enjoy a great choice of highly regarded schools, ensuring quality education for your family both private and public. Close to Wesley College, Shopping Facilities: Experience premier shopping at Dundrum Town Centre, featuring high-end retailers and various dining options, alongside the charming local shops in Stillorgan Village.\nMedical Centres: Access to excellent healthcare services and medical clinics nearby.\nSuperb Transport Links: Benefit from incredible public transport options, including the LUAS for quick and easy journeys to Dublin city centre.\nClose to the M50: For swift access to many locations including the Sandyford Business Park, the new College for Dentistry \n\nProperty Features:\n\nSet Back from the Main Road: Enjoy tranquillity and privacy in this home that is tastefully set back from busy thoroughfares.\nLow Maintenance Red Brick Façade: The attractive and durable exterior provides both style and ease of care.\nSouth Facing Rear Garden: Revel in sunny afternoons and outdoor gatherings in your beautifully landscaped, private garden.\nImmaculate Interiors: The property is presented in immaculate condition throughout, showcasing high-quality finishes that exemplify refined living. The thoughtful design and attention to detail create an inviting ambiance perfect for families or .\nIncluded: As a bonus, the sale includes all the fitted carpets, curtains, blinds, light fitting (Living room and dining area specifically excluded) and kitchen appliance as stated, making it easy to move in and begin enjoying your new home immediately.\n\nWhy Choose This Home? This exceptional A2 rated residence combines the best of luxury living with a prime location in one of Dublin`s most desirable areas. Move-in ready, it is the perfect blend of comfort, style, and convenience ideal for anyone seeking a vibrant lifestyle amidst a welcoming community.\n\nAccommodation:\n\nEntrance Hallway: c. 5.0m x 2.61m max. \n\nSecurity alarm, generous under stairs storage, recessed lighting, coving, tiled floor.\n\nGuest W.c.: c. 1.88m x 1.83m max. \n\nW.C., wash hand basin with under vanity storage in matching suite, heated towel rail, recessed lighting, tiled floor. \n\nLiving Room: c. 6.32m x 3.74m max. \n\nFeature inset fireplace, coving, wood laminated flooring. Double doors lead to:\n \nKitchen/Dining Room: c. 5.58m x 5.34m max. \n\nFully modern kitchen with an excellent range of fitted presses and cupboards and feature wine rack. Telxa stainless steel sink unit, polished white quartz countertops, tiled splashbacks. Smeg 5 plate induction hob, Faber extractor hood, Smeg integrated dishwasher, Smeg microwave, Smeg Fridge and Smeg Freezer. Tiled floor. Opening to: \n\nFamily Room: c. 4.13m x 2.77m \n\nVaulted ceiling with Velux windows, recessed lighting, tiled flooring, sliding door to south facing rear garden. \n\nFirst floor:\n\nLanding: c.7.15m x 3.82m\n\nL-shaped,\n\nUtility Room; C 1.78m x 1.40m.\n\nPlumbed for washing machine and tumble dryer. Fitted shelving.\n\nBedroom 1: c. 5.35m x 3.74m. \n\nLarge bright room to the front of the house. Built in wardrobes with overhead storage. Door to:\n\nEn suite: c. 1.86m x 1.64m. \n\nStand in shower with Rainhead showerhead, W.C., wash hand basin with storage in matching suite, medicine cabinet, heated towel rail, recessed lighting, half tiled walls and tiled floor.\n\nBedroom 2: c. 3.61m x 2.77m.\n \nBuilt in wardrobes with overhead storage\n\nBedroom 3: c. 3.61m x 2.91m \n\nBuilt in wardrobes with overhead storage\n\nBathroom: c. 2.45m x 1.86m max. \n\nBath with Rainhead showerhead, W.C., wash hand basin with storage in matching suite, medicine cabinet, heated towel rail, recessed lighting, half tiled walls and tiled floor. \n\nSecond Floor Landing: \n\nVelux window, coving, large walk-in closet with under eaves storage (c. 2.53m x 2.51m)\n\nMain Bedroom: c. 7.15m x 4.53m. \n\nVelux window, large under eaves storage, recessed lighting, double doors to balcony with views over Dublin. Door to:\n\nEn suite: c. 2.77m x 2.48m \n\nLarge walk-in shower with Rainhead showerhead, W.C., wash hand basin with storage in matching suite, Medicine cabinet, heated towel rail, recessed lighting, tiled walls and floor. Velux window\n\nWalk-in wardrobe area: c.2.91m x 2.13m\n\n(Presently used as a study). Fitted shelving and storage area Velux window,\n\nOutside:\n\nLovey walled southerly facing walled rear garden with white cherry blossom borders, lovely synthetic lawn and large patio area. Timber garden shed. Pedestrian access to rear. Pedestrian access to landscaped walled front garden with 2 designated car parking spaces and EV charging point.\n\nBER DETAILS\n\nBER: A3\nBER No: 108873498\nEnergy Performance Indicator: 51.39 kWh/m2/yr\n\nManagement Company: Smith Management Company \nService Charge: Approx: 980.00\n\nContact Janet Carroll Estate Agents Today. Don`t miss out on this incredible opportunity. For further information or to arrange a viewing, please contact janet@janetcarroll.ie to schedule a viewing. \n\nOFFERS:\n\nOffers to be sent in writing to janet@janetcarroll.ie\n\nDIRECTIONS\n\nGoogle search Eircode D14 RX06 from your current location.\nPrimary Schools (National Schools):\n\n•Holy Cross-National School (Dundrum): Located on Upper Kilmacud Road.\n•St Raphaela`s Primary School: St Raphaela`s Road, Kilmacud\n•Oatlands Primary School: 34 Woodlands Avenue, Stillorgan\n•Taney Parish Primary School (Dundrum): Located on Sydenham Villas.\n•Queen of Angels Primary School (Wedgewood): Located near Sandyford Road.\n•Mount Anville Primary School and after care \n•St Brigids National School\n•Ballinteer Educate Together National School (Balally): Located on Parkvale.\n•Our Lady`s Grove Primary School (Goatstown): Located on Goatstown Road. \n St. Brigid`s National School Stillorgan\n\nSecondary Schools\n\n•Jesus and Mary College (Our Lady`s Grove) (Goatstown): Secondary school located on Goatstown Road.\n•St Raphaela`s Secondary School: St Raphaela`s Road, Kilmacud\n•St. Tiernan`s Community School (Balally/Dundrum): Located between Dundrum and Sandyford.\n•Wesley College (Ballinteer): Located in Ballinteer.\n•St Benildus College (Kilmacud): Located on Kilmacud Road Upper.\n•Notre Dame Secondary School (Churchtown): Located on Upper Churchtown Road.\n•Oatlands College (Mount Merrion/Stillorgan): Located nearby in Mount Merrion. \n\nOther Nearby Schools & Further Education:\n\n•St. Kilian`s Deutsche Schule (Clonskeagh): A German school located on Roebuck Road.\n•Dundrum College of Further Education (Dundrum): Located on Main Street. \n•Colaiste Eoin and Iosgáin: Stillorgan Road\n\nIMPORTANT NOTICE:\n\nJanet Carroll Estate Agents for themselves and for the vendors or lessors of this property whose agents they are, give notice that: - (i) The particulars are set out as a general outline for the guidance of intending purchasers or lessees, and do not constitute part of, an offer or contract. (ii) All descriptions, dimensions, references to condition and necessary permissions for use and occupation, and any other details are given in good faith and are believed to be correct, but any intending purchasers or tenants should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact but satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them. (iii) No person in the employment of Janet Carroll Estate Agents has any authority to make or give any representations or warranty whatsoever in relation to this property.\n\nPLEASE NOTE:\n\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs provided are for guidance only."
